<p><p>Karbala mein jo khate fatima sughra aaya<br />
padhke ye baat bohot shaah ko rona aaya<br />
hashr mein hogi mulaqat hamari baba<br />
arey ab na jee paaegi beemaar tumhari baba</p>

<p>Sughra ne likha baba, mushkil hai mera jeena<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, haye meri qabr pe aajana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>1. Jab doobta hai suraj, dil doobne lagta hai<br />
veeran hai sab hujre, ghar qabr ke jaisa hai<br />
hai mere muqaddar mein, tanhai mein marjana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>2. Hai paas ajal mere, tum door ho sughra se<br />
hasrat ye liye baba, jaati hu mai duniya se<br />
kaandha to janaze ko, mumkin na huwa dena<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>3. Aata hai palat kar jab, pardes se ghar koi<br />
maloom hai sughra ko, hoti hai thakan fir bhi<br />
aye baba meri khatir, zehmat ye utha lena<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>4. Aakar meri turbat par, sab shamma jalaenge<br />
aur bhai sirhane par, yaseen sunaenge<br />
hojaega is tarha, aabad wo veerana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>5. Ae kaash madine mein, wo paas mere rehta<br />
sughra ke janaze par, ek bhai to ro leta<br />
baba mere asghar ko, turbat meri dikhlana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>6. Bhai ki mohabbat par, na harf koi aaye<br />
maloom na ho unko, ye raaz hi reh jaaye<br />
marne ka sabab meri, bhabhi ko na batlana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>7. Rukh hoga lahad mein bhi, aye baba suwe qibla<br />
mai qabr mein jaakar bhi, dekhungi tera rasta<br />
acha mere vaade ko, tum yu hi nibha lena<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>

<p>8. Karti thi takallum wo, ye bayn qayamat ka<br />
dastoor nahi hota, murde se mohabbat ka<br />
amma ko magar baba, paigham ye pohchana<br />
jab laut ke aaoge, meri qabr pe aajana</p>
</p>